    {
      "version": "0.2.0",
      "channel": "stable",
      "date": "2026-06-03",
      "status": "available",
      "source": {
        "repository": "https://github.com/DreamWeave-MP/greenmote",
        "tag": "0.2.0",
        "revision": "aea7a6af38f9b3e3f4b6a9c6c442661d8af5f666"
      },
      "notes": {
        "summary": "Unclip deletes grass on roads and grass that ends up under water, the GUI has tabs and runs several plugins in turn, and Greenmote is GPL-3.0-only.",
        "added": [
          "The `water-delete` and `road-delete` unclip actions, with configurable road texture patterns.",
          "Scriptless activators are converted like statics.",
          "Convert, Unclip and Settings tabs in the GUI; the Unclip tab runs a list of plugins one after another, can be cancelled, and can write each to its own output plugin."
        ],
        "changed": [
          "Unclip writes by default; `--dry-run` inspects without writing.",
          "Tree-like statics no longer count as occluders by default.",
          "Unknown `greenmote.toml` keys are ignored instead of rejected, and run-time choices are no longer saved to it.",
          "Greenmote is licensed GPL-3.0-only; 0.1.0 carried no license."
        ],
        "fixed": [
          "Static collision follows `RootCollisionNode`, including hidden ones.",
          "Without a discoverable `openmw.cfg`, the default user config is used without asking.",
          "Unclip is much faster on large plugins."
        ]
      },
